'''Silverbacks''' were a subspecies of the [[Sentience|sentient]] [[Wookiee]] [[species]] on [[Kashyyyk]]. Two silverbacks were [[Wullffwarro]] and his son [[Kitwarr]], who were taken into [[slavery]] by the [[Galactic Empire]] before being [[Mission to free Wookiee prisoners|rescued]] by the [[Spectres]].<ref name="TRB" />

==Behind the scenes==
Silverbacks were first mentioned in the [[2011]] [[Star Wars Legends|Legends]] [[Star Wars video games|video game]] ''[[Star Wars: The Old Republic]]'',<ref name="TOR">''[[Star Wars: The Old Republic]]''</ref> and were [[canon]]ized by ''[[The Rebellion Begins]]'', a [[2014]] junior novelization of ''[[Star Wars Rebels: Spark of Rebellion]]''.<ref name="TRB" />

